    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A familiar fruit merge puzzle game where you drop fruit into a container, but with a naughty twist.\u00a0 Instead of dropping fruit, you drop jiggly boobs wearing fruit themed bikinis!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raising your score will reward you with nudity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/c20263d9a7690dba0e9b19862c238919.poster.avif?t=1749037129\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/c20263d9a7690dba0e9b19862c238919.webm?t=1749037129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/c20263d9a7690dba0e9b19862c238919.mp4?t=1749037129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a bartender on a nude beach resort.\u00a0 It's your job to help new guests relax and become comfortable with their nudity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your special fruit mocktails have a special ability to expand the boob size of the guests AND dissolve their worries away... and their swimsuits :)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Biggle, More Jiggle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The higher your score the bigger and more jiggly the boobs of your guest get.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/29fc530f3140a60a76576dd4cc1687c6.poster.avif?t=1749037129\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/29fc530f3140a60a76576dd4cc1687c6.webm?t=1749037129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/29fc530f3140a60a76576dd4cc1687c6.mp4?t=1749037129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Powerups</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the container gets too &quot;stacked&quot; you can use powerups to stay in the game.\u00a0 <br>Maybe use a bomb to clear some space or a plasma ball to destroy all melons of the same fruit.<br>Maybe use the beach ball and see what happens...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's not cheating.\u00a0 Honest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gallery Rewards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 2 x gallery images to unlock for each guest as a reward.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mastery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You get 1 x star for completing the level<br>If you are skilled you can earn additional stars for\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the level under the limit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Merge a <strong>Megamelon</strong> (Watermelon) at least once.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you earn all 3 stars?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/9c1548589e8038ecc0c046b678860f70.poster.avif?t=1749037129\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/9c1548589e8038ecc0c046b678860f70.webm?t=1749037129\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3537000/extras/9c1548589e8038ecc0c046b678860f70.mp4?t=1749037129\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
